{
  "editable": true,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "tags": ["slo", "demo", "demo-load"],
  "title": "SLA / SLO / SLI — demo-load",
  "uid": "slo-demo-load",
  "description": "SLA/SLO/SLI proof for demo-load. SLO: error rate < 1% over 5m. k6 mix is ~5% GET /error and will breach.",
  "timezone": "browser",
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "datasource",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {
          "text": "Prometheus",
          "value": "prometheus"
        },
        "hide": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "Runbook DemoLoadErrorRateSLOBreach",
      "type": "link",
      "icon": "doc",
      "targetBlank": true,
      "url": "{{publicBaseURL}}/ui/grafana/d/demo-load-error-rate-slo-breach/"
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "SLA / SLO / SLI",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "transparent": true,
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "code": {
          "language": "markdown",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        },
        "content": "# SLA, SLO и SLI для `demo-load`\n\n| Термин | Что это | В этом стенде |\n|---|---|---|\n| **SLA** | Что **обещаем клиенту** | 99% успешных HTTP-ответов (не 5xx). Это внешнее обещание. |\n| **SLO** | Внутренняя **цель**, к которой стремимся и по которой алертим | Error rate **< 1%** за 5 минут (`DemoLoadErrorRateSLOBreach`, `for: 1m`). |\n| **SLI** | Что **измеряем** | Доля 5xx: `sum(rate(demo_http_requests_total{code=~\"5..\"}[5m])) / sum(rate(demo_http_requests_total[5m]))` |\n\nПорог **1%** выбран так, чтобы штатный k6 (`for-load-test/k6`: ~80% `/work`, ~15% `/slow`, **~5% `/error`**) **гарантированно зажёг** алерт. После `kubectl -n demo delete job demo-load-k6` SLI должен вернуться ниже 1%.\n\nRunbook: [DemoLoadErrorRateSLOBreach]({{publicBaseURL}}/ui/grafana/d/demo-load-error-rate-slo-breach/) · логи: [K8s App Logs ns=demo]({{publicBaseURL}}/ui/grafana/d/k8s-app-logs?var-namespace=demo) · трейсы: [Jaeger demo-load]({{publicBaseURL}}/ui/jaeger/search?service=demo-load)\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "SLI: error rate (5m)",
      "description": "Доля 5xx / все запросы demo-load. Красный, если выше SLO 1%.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(demo_http_requests_total{namespace=\"demo\",code=~\"5..\"}[5m])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(demo_http_requests_total{namespace=\"demo\"}[5m])), 1e-9)",
          "legendFormat": "error rate",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 2,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.01
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "SLO порог",
      "description": "Внутренняя цель: error rate < 1% за 5m.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 9
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "vector(0.01)",
          "legendFormat": "SLO",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Error budget (остаток)",
      "description": "Доля неиспользованного бюджета 1%. 100% = чисто, 0% = бюджет исчерпан, <0 = перерасход (k6 ~5% ошибок).",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 9
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "(0.01 - (sum(rate(demo_http_requests_total{namespace=\"demo\",code=~\"5..\"}[5m])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(demo_http_requests_total{namespace=\"demo\"}[5m])), 1e-9))) / 0.01",
          "legendFormat": "budget left",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0.5
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
